{"brief":"The user likes horror and action movies, citing guns, action, and excitement as appealing features. They named Saving Private Ryan as one of their favorite films, describing it as an epic depiction of World War II. Their specific reasons for enjoying horror remain unexplored.

They dislike musicals because they find them annoying and prefer movies whose themes are not conveyed through singing. They also disliked Ghostbusters (2016). When the interviewer suggested that it failed to live up to the original, the user explicitly agreed; they offered no further explanation.

The user has seen Star Wars: The Last Jedi and thought it was fantastic, specifically praising the spaceships and saying they loved all the Star Wars characters."}
